================================================================================
Where c-lord came from
================================================================================

c-lord began on 2026-02-22 as a copy of the source code of
claude-code-discord-bridge, written by Masahiko Ebisuda (@ebibibi) and
published under the MIT License:

    https://github.com/ebibibi/claude-code-discord-bridge
    (since renamed: https://github.com/ebibibi/ebi-agent-chat-relay)

c-lord has been developed separately since then and most of it has been
rewritten, but portions of that original code remain in this repository and in
the packages built from it. The copyright notice and permission notice of the
original work are reproduced in full below, as its license requires. That
notice covers only the portions that come from claude-code-discord-bridge;
everything else in c-lord is Copyright (c) 2026 yousan, under the MIT License
in LICENSE.

Thank you, Masahiko Ebisuda, for the code this project started from.

